          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Frame duration treated as the target budget. A frame longer than this turns the frame-time row red and is counted by the Over row, which reports the overruns among the 120 frames the sparkline plots. The sparkline's vertical range is twice the budget, so the guide line drawn across it always marks the budget and a reassigned budget rescales the plot with it. Defaults to one 60 Hz frame."
        },
